-leg twin of the assembled package. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.tauAssignmentNat","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.tauAssignmentNat","kind":"def","line":248,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeTauAssignmentGroupoidFunctor.lean#L248-L259","doc":"**THE ASSEMBLED FUNCTOR PACKAGE**: the τ-assignment family is a\nnatural transformation from the state functor to the constant isotypic\nfunctor on the marked-pair category. Naturality at each morphism is\nprecisely the coherence square. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.markedIsotypicFunctor","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.markedIsotypicFunctor","kind":"def","line":244,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeTauAssignmentGroupoidFunctor.lean#L244-L246","doc":"The constant functor at the isotypic slot. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.markedStateFunctor","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.markedStateFunctor","kind":"def","line":238,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeTauAssignmentGroupoidFunctor.lean#L238-L242","doc":"The contravariant state functor: every marked pair sees the full\nstate space, and marking morphisms act by pullback. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.instIsIsoMarkedPairConjEdge","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.instIsIsoMarkedPairConjEdge","kind":"instance","line":215,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeTauA